      <div><div class="approach-title">Irrigation Audit &amp; Smart Controller Conversion</div><div class="approach-body">Campus irrigation zone-by-zone assessment. Controller schedule reviewed against current ET rates and campus calendar. Smart controller programming implemented with weather station integration, rain sensor validation, and seasonal schedule adjustment. Documented consumption targets set for AASHE sustainability reporting.</div></div>
